every published figure independently with their own maskers: mirrorRgb|mirror_rgb 57 -> 0 with
main's per-file split (gaf.c 40, gaf.h 10, gui_surf.c 7), atlasRgb 30 -> 5 with the five
survivors line for line, opengl_utils.h includers 6 -> 5, gl-sites narrow 252 unchanged and
